---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import data from '../data/clubhouse.json';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const featured = data.memes.find(m=>m.featured);
---
<Layout title="Clubhouse" active="home"><div class="dashboard"><div><section class="lead" aria-labelledby="headline"><span class="pill">THE MORNING SKATE / SAMPLE EDITION</span><div class="eyebrow">Daily recap / style preview</div><h1 id="headline">The bench would<br/>like a word.</h1><p>A sample of the morning broadcast: questionable lineup decisions, original chirps, and a healthy respect for the receipts. No actual league results are represented.</p><a class="btn" href={`${base}recaps/sample/`}>Read the sample edition <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><section aria-labelledby="matchups"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="matchups">This week's matchups</h2><span class="small muted">NOT CONNECTED</span></div><div class="empty"><strong>The scoreboard is waiting on ESPN.</strong><p>No matchup totals yet. Head-to-head is confirmed; points versus categories, roster rules, and historical lineups still need verification.</p><span class="small">A daily recap is not a final matchup result.</span></div></section><section aria-labelledby="standings"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="standings">League standings</h2><span class="small muted">NO VERIFIED DATA</span></div><div class="empty"><p>Actual ranks and records will appear after authorized retrieval. No imaginary champions here.</p></div></section><section><div class="section-heading"><h2>Meet the management</h2><a href={`${base}managers/`}>All profiles →</a></div>{data.managers.map(m=><a class="mini-profile" href={`${base}managers/${m.slug}/`}><img class="avatar mini-portrait" src={`${base}${m.image}`} alt={`${m.alias} — owner-labeled portrait`} width="54" height="54" loading="lazy" /><span><strong>{m.alias}</strong><small>{m.team} · owner-supplied</small></span><span style="margin-left:auto" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</section></div><aside class="sidebar"><section class="status" aria-labelledby="status-heading"><div class="eyebrow">DATA DESK</div><h2 id="status-heading">Freshness matters.</h2><div class="status-value">Not connected</div><p class="small muted">No successful ESPN results refresh</p><dl><dt>Target refresh</dt><dd>05:00 · America/Phoenix</dd><dt>Recap coverage</dt><dd>Previous Arizona calendar day</dd><dt>Current content</dt><dd>DEMO DATA · Not live results</dd></dl><p class="small divider">Stale-data warning: live data is unavailable. Sample content is never treated as fresh league data.</p><a class="btn" href={`${base}recaps/#connection`}>Connection & refresh help</a></section>{featured&&<section class="featured"><div class="eyebrow">FROM THE MEME LOCKER / DEMO</div><a href={`${base}memes/`}><img src={`${base}${featured.image}`} width="780" height="600" alt={featured.caption}/></a><p>{featured.caption}</p><a class="small" href={`${base}memes/`}>Browse the locker →</a></section>}</aside></div></Layout>
